{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_18208210","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"18208210","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"cinematic_dialogue:3:1820820001:":{"text":"大丈夫よ ヒルダ","source_cn":"放心吧，希尔达","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE3568084747ADE4D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:3:1820820002:":{"text":"うん……ありがとう ベシアン","source_cn":"谢谢你……蓓丝安","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9EC6145D94A78DFE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1820821001:1":{"text":"ヒルダ、心配しないで。誰も侵入できないように、罠を仕掛けておいたから。","source_cn":"别担心，希尔达，我会设好陷阱，以防外人闯入。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x154FF85550E0C33B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1820821002:1":{"text":"それから……障害物も置いておいた。これで簡単には外に出られないと思う……","source_cn":"还有……障碍我也弄好了，你应该没法轻易逃出去。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x29FFED1F0AE088A2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1820821003:1":{"text":"手伝ってくれてありがとう。ベシアンがいてくれて、本当によかった。","source_cn":"谢谢你帮我这个忙，蓓丝安。有你真好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x34CE6DDD013BE70C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1820821004:1":{"text":"私さえこの樹洞の中にいれば、誰を傷つけることもない。少し寂しさはあるけど……あとで後悔するよりずっといいものね。","source_cn":"只要我能一直呆在树洞里，我就不会跑出去伤害大家了……虽...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A81644DA6163E78","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1820821005:1":{"text":"ほんとは、こんなことしたくない……","source_cn":"但我不想这样，希尔达……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDDA723D66F6D9DDE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1820821006:1":{"text":"どうして……みんな、あんなふうになっちゃうの！？大切な人さえ思い出せず、最後には正気を失って……","source_cn":"为什么……大家最后都变成了那样？不记得自己是谁，认不出...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x59E4CD15BCA6331E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1820821007:1":{"text":"それがグレイヴボーンの宿命だから……長い間、パーツを交換できなければ、心も少しずつすり減っていく……","source_cn":"这就是亡灵的宿命，蓓丝安。若是太久没有更换肢体，大家的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBDEE96B41EE39EF8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1820821008:1":{"text":"バンティスが禁令を出したときから、私は覚悟できてるよ！","source_cn":"从班题斯的禁令下达的那一刻，我就知道会这样了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2601653A49FF95DF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1820821009:1":{"text":"……何度でも会いに来るから。それと……新しい<style=\"highlight\">ナイフ</style>を作ってきたんだ。","source_cn":"……我会经常来看你的，希尔达。还有，我做了一把新的<s...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB6E0327C813F9FCA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1820821010:1":{"text":"綺麗……魔力も込められてるのね。","source_cn":"好漂亮……上面竟然还有魔力。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC5F4472B884A22F2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:15::2":{"text":"証","source_cn":"信物","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE81F0E9483C907B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1820821011:1":{"text":"うん。前のやつは折れちゃったでしょ。だから今度のは、もっと丈夫に作ったの……へへ、あなたの親友が作った自信作よ。忘れたりしたら許さないから！","source_cn":"嗯，我知道你手上的那把已经断了，这把更结实耐用。只要看...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3B1F12CB8CFD43A3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1820821012:0":{"text":"絶対……正気を失わないで。","source_cn":"就是……多这样想想，或许能保持精神稳定？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8B843EEA71268DD2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1820821013:1":{"text":"ありがとう……二人の<style=\"highlight\">友情の証</style>だ。宝物にするね。","source_cn"